    "title": "Good Bait FZR 188F",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>FZR is not same as other top water stick baits</span></p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>FZR is not rear balanced top water stick bait.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>It is flat balanced. Not same as other popular stick baits.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>This is most unique point and that is why it was born.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>You can make small splash and diving action if you jerk on the top water.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Also you can keep swim under water if you keep jerk before float up.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>It is all up to you.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Basically we designed it based on #4/0 treble hooks. But you can use #3/0 depends on situation. You can use single hooks, single hooks can make more wide zig-zag action.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Length 188 mm</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Gr. 92</p></li></ul><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"></p>",
